§§ `W18: two rules for the same shortfall of assets on a transfer of portfolio: a pro rata refund (Dieu 27(4)) and a negotiated reduction (Dieu 92(3))`

@@q 670 678
@@q 1953 1960
@ref Dieu 27, 92 (src:670-678; src:1953-1960)
@@fx `a termination on a portfolio transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve` : `A unilateral termination` ; `ground` = `the policyholder did not agree to the transfer of the portfolio under Dieu 92(4)` ; `terminating party` = `the policyholder` ; `surrender value` = 3_000_000 ; `the contract has a surrender value` = TRUE ; `value of the transferred assets` = 80 ; `technical reserve of the transferred portfolio` = 100
@@fx `a required transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve` : `A portfolio transfer` ; `the Ministry of Finance required it under Dieu 113(8)(c) or (d)` = TRUE ; `value of the assets transferred` = 80 ; `technical reserve of the whole portfolio transferred` = 100
#ASSERT `Dieu 27(4): the amount the policyholder receives back` `a termination on a portfolio transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve` EQUALS 2_400_000
#ASSERT `Dieu 92(3): the receiving insurer must agree a reduction of sums insured or benefits with the policyholders` `a required transfer with assets at 80 percent of the reserve`

