@@fx `a suicide a year after a restoration of a ten-year-old contract` : `A death or injury of the insured person` ; `the insured person died by suicide` = TRUE ; `date of the first premium payment or of the restoration of the contract` = YMD 2025 3 1 ; `date of death` = YMD 2026 3 1
#ASSERT `Dieu 40(1): the insurer need not pay the claimant` `a suicide a year after a restoration of a ten-year-old contract` FALSE

§§ `W21: Dieu 25(1)(h) makes a deceit-induced contract void unless the deceit is the Dieu 22 conduct, for which Dieu 22 gives rescission`

@@q 593 618
@ref Dieu 25 (src:593-618)
@@fx `a deceit that is Dieu 22 conduct` : `The formation of a contract` ; `the contract was made as a result of deceit` = TRUE ; `the deceit is the deliberate conduct dealt with in Dieu 22` = TRUE
@@fx `an adult` : `A person`
#ASSERT NOT `Dieu 25(1): the contract is void` `a deceit that is Dieu 22 conduct` `an adult`
